# MaCSad public masthead

The masthead carries publication identity without private application state.

## Component PublicMasthead:
    View:
        css ".masthead { padding: 22px clamp(22px,5vw,72px); color: #f8f4e8; background: #102c3b; border-bottom: 1px solid #274b59; } .masthead-inner { max-width: 1240px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 24px; margin: auto; } .wordmark { display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 12px; } .wordmark strong { font: 780 20px/1 Georgia, serif; letter-spacing: -.02em; } .wordmark span { color: #afc3cb; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: .1em; text-transform: uppercase; } .seal { padding: 7px 10px; color: #d8ff72; border: 1px solid rgba(216,255,114,.38); border-radius: 999px; font: 700 10px/1 ui-monospace, monospace; letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase; } @media (max-width: 820px) { .wordmark span { display: none; } }"
        header [class="masthead"]:
            div [class="masthead-inner"]:
                div [class="wordmark"]:
                    strong: "MaCSad"
                    span: "Public research record"
                span [class="seal"]: "Evidence first"
